.\" kubectl-kpm(1) - kubectl plugin shim for kpm
.TH KUBECTL-KPM 1 "2026-10-10" "kpm v0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kubectl-kpm \- kubectl plugin entrypoint for kpm
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kubectl kpm
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kubectl-kpm
is the same binary as
.BR kpm (1),
installed under the
.B kubectl\-
prefix so
.B kubectl
discovers it as a plugin (
.BR "kubectl kpm \.\.\."
).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kpm (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Hermes Rodríguez and contributors.
